  "description": "The Hula Prefilled Pod System Kit is a compact and rechargeable pod vape designed to deliver longer-lasting performance in a simple, mess-free format. Each device arrives ready to use, preloaded with 12ml of 20mg nicotine salt e-liquid, split between a 2ml draw-activated pod and a 10ml refill chamber built into the same unit. Thanks to its smart auto-feed technology, the Hula pod automatically draws liquid from the refill chamber as needed, providing up to 7000 puffs (approx.) with no refilling, no coil changes, and no mess. A built-in dual mesh coil ensures smooth, consistent vapour and flavour throughout, while two selectable modes — Normal and Boost — let you switch between longer battery life and higher vapour output. The internal 950mAh battery provides all-day vaping power and recharges quickly via USB-C in under 45 minutes. An LED battery indicator keeps you updated on remaining charge, and the slim, draw-activated design makes the Hula ideal for MTL (mouth-to-lung) vaping on the go. Available in a choice of 10 popular flavours, the Hula offers a flavour-rich and fuss-free alternative to single-use disposable vapes. Hula 7000 Prefilled Kit Flavours Strawberry Kiwi Triple Mango Kiwi Passionfruit Guava Menthol Pineapple Cola Double Apple Cherry Watermelon Blue Sour Raspberry Fizzy Orange Grape Hawaii Lemon Lime Pink Lemonade Raspberry Chew Strawberry Banana Strawberry Cherry Raspberry Triple Blue Watermelon Peach Mango How To Set Up Your Hula 7000 Prefilled Kit Step Instructions 1 Charge your Hula Device: Plug into a USB-C cable to ensure the battery is fully charged. 2 Separate all the Parts: Pull the pod, refill container, and battery apart from one another. 3 Prepare The Pod: Remove the red silicone plugs from the pod and also remove the sticker from the base of the pod. 4 Prepare the Refill Container: Remove the sticker that is around the refill container. 5 Assemble the Refill: Place the pod into the refill container and push together firmly until it clicks into place. 6 Attach the Refill: Insert the refill into the battery. Now you’re good to go! Please Note: This kit does NOT come with a USB-C cable Love the Hula 7000? Explore our full range of prefilled vapes for more flavours and kits. Shop Hula 7000 Refill Pods",
